        "text_kEPybV": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>At <strong>Overtake</strong>, customer satisfaction is our top priority. If you have received a wrong, defective, or damaged product, we are here to help.</p><h3><strong>Conditions for Return</strong></h3><p>You may return your product under the following circumstances:</p><ul><li><strong>Wrong Size or Wrong Product</strong>: If the product received does not match the size or product you ordered.</li><li><strong>Defective or Damaged Product</strong>: If the product is defective or damaged upon arrival.</li></ul><h3><strong>How to Initiate a Return</strong></h3><ol><li><strong>Contact Us</strong>: Please email us at <a>support@overtake.pt</a> to report the issue. Include your order number, a description of the problem, and, if possible, photographic evidence of the issue.</li><li><strong>Verification</strong>: Our support team will review your case. If we verify that the issue is indeed from our part, we will approve the return.</li></ol><h3><strong>Return Process</strong></h3><ul><li><strong>Shipping Fees</strong>: If the return is approved, you will not be responsible for any return shipping fees. We will provide you with a prepaid return shipping label.</li><li><strong>Packaging</strong>: The product must be returned in the same condition and packaging as it was received, without any signs of use.</li><li><strong>Refund</strong>: Once we receive the returned product and verify its condition, we will process your refund.</li></ul><h3><strong>Important Notes</strong></h3><ul><li>All returns must be initiated within 14 days after receiving your order.</li><li>Returned items must be unused and in their original packaging.</li><li>Refunds will be processed to the original payment method within 7 business days after we receive the returned item.</li></ul><p>For any questions or further assistance, please feel free to contact our support team at <a>support@overtake.pt</a>.</p><p>Thank you for shopping with <strong>Overtake</strong>!</p>"
          }
        }
